window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.rowsHtml+="<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1630\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1630\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1651\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀεινεφεῖς</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosa relativa a obscurecimentos ou cegueiras, τυφλώσεις; conservar o original para cotejo.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1631\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1631\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1652\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείνως</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Forma ática contraída de ἀείναος, relacionada a ἀέναος.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1632\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1632\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1653\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειπαθής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Perpetuamente passivo, que sofre ou recebe ação sem cessar.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1633\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1633\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1654\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειπάθεια</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Passividade perpétua.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1634\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1634\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1655\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειπαλής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Que bate continuamente; de coração.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1635\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1635\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1656\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειπάρθενος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sempre virgem, virgem perpétua; também das vestais.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1636\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1636\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1657\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείπλανος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Que vagueia ou erra incessantemente.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1637\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1637\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1658\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄειρον</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosas distintas: ἄειρον, não dito ou indizível e não adulado; ἄειρος, forma associada a ἄπειρος, sem experiência ou ilimitado. Conservar ambiguidades originais.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1638\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1638\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1659\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείροος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Equivalente ao verbete seguinte, ἀείρυτος; variante contraída ἀείρους.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1639\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1639\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1660\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείρυτος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Que flui sem cessar; de fonte ou nascente.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1640\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1640\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1661\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείρω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Erguer, levantar, alçar, içar, elevar; tomar, retirar ou transportar; erguer-se e elevar-se em usos médios ou passivos; extensões figuradas e técnicas numerosas. Artigo extenso: flexão e acepções detalhadas no TEI.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1641\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1641\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1662\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείς</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Particípio de ἄημι, soprar; forma não definida independentemente.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1642\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1642\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1663\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείσε</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Forma tardia de ἀεί, «sempre».</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1643\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1643\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1664\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀεισιτία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Privilégio de alimentação ou sustento permanente, concedido ao ἀείσιτος.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1644\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1644\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1665\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείσιτος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Que recebe sustento permanente; comensal mantido às expensas públicas, inclusive no Pritaneu ateniense.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1645\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1645\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1666\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείσκωψ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Espécie de coruja, talvez o mocho-de-orelhas (Ephialtes scops); identificação zoológica incerta.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1646\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1646\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1667\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄεισμα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Forma jônica ou poética de ᾆσμα, canto ou canção.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1647\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1647\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1668\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείστροφος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Que gira sempre, de rotação incessante.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1648\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1648\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1669\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείτας</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Forma beócia de ἀετός, águia; remissão a ἀΐτας.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1649\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1649\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1670\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειτελής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Perpetuamente perfeito, de deus.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1650\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1650\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1671\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄειτον</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Rápido, veloz; glosa ταχύ.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1651\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1651\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1672\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειφανής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sempre acima do horizonte, de estrelas; também sempre resplandecente.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1652\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1652\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1673\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειφεγγής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sempre luminoso, que brilha sem cessar.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1653\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1653\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1674\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειφόρος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Equivalente a ἀειθαλής, sempre florescente ou perene; atestação duvidosa.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1654\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1654\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1675\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείφρουρος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sempre vigilante; figuradamente, eterno, inclusive de morada sepulcral.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>";
